// V2 2.9.0 (owner, 2026-11-12): a SIDE version. It runs beside the active 2.8.0 on its own new PAPER ledgers
// ($10K: data/v29/original_paper, $1K: data/v29/small_account_paper) and is never copied to professional_v2.json
// by this build. Its manifest is manifest_professional_v2_2.9.0.json next to this file.
// It is 2.8.0 with exactly the three changes from the 11/12 review:
//   1. in_play: each morning trade only the up to 8 stocks of the ~105 on strategies/v29_universe.json whose
//      first 15 minutes of volume is at least 2x their own 20-session average (stocks with news / a big gap).
//   2. stop_policy + no breakeven move: stop at least 1% of the price away (2.8.0's median was 0.52%), target at
//      least 2 stops away, winners still run (let_winners_run); management.breakeven.enabled false.
//   3. contract_policy: 1-6 day contracts, nearest expiration first (about half the round-trip cost).
// Everything else (filters, regime, sector, events, sizing, cost logging, advisor veto) is 2.8.0's.
